# Metrics are records written by the tooling, not source. Prettier collapses the short arrays that
# JSON.stringify(x, null, 2) always expands, so every run would fail format:check — and reformatting
# them rewrites evidence that is supposed to stay byte-stable.
specs/*/metrics/

# Same reasoning for everything else in a spec's directory: the generated half of spec.md, the ACCS
# and its helpers are all written by `pnpm enrich`, so format:check would go red on files nobody is
# allowed to edit.
specs/*/

node_modules
dist
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Hand-written prompts. Reformatting would alter text no AI may edit.
.ai/
